NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000373 "feature."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000374 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000375 "=head1 SEE ALSO"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000376 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000377 "L<Complete::Path>. Conceptually, L</complete_sequence> is similar to"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000378 "C<complete_path> from L<Complete::Path>. Except unlike a path, a sequence does"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000379 "not (necessarily) have path separator."
